<messaging:emailTemplate subject="Items Needed for your Refinance" recipientType="Lead">
<messaging:htmlEmailBody >
<html>
<head>
<style type="text/css">
.myButton {
    display: inline-block;
    vertical-align: middle;
    padding: 12px 24px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: #0082cb;
    font: normal normal bold 20px arial;
    color: #ffffff !important;
    text-decoration: none;
}
.myButton:hover,
.myButton:focus {
    background: #142850;
    cursor: pointer;
}
</style>
</head>
<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">
<span class="container"></span>
<p>Hi {{BORROWER_FIRST_NAME}},<br />
<br />
It was good speaking with you! Below are the items I need to get your refinance underway. Once you have uploaded them to the secure portal, I will review everything and come back to you with your options and next steps.</p>
{{REQUESTED_DOCUMENT_LIST}}
<br />
<p>Here is a link to your secure portal:</p>
<div><a class="myButton" href="{{LEAD_PORTAL_LINK}}">Upload Files</a></div>
<br />
<p>Send over whatever you have to hand and we can work through the rest together. If any item does not apply to your situation, just reply and let me know so I can take it off the list.</p>
<span class="end-container"></span>
<p>{{SENDER_SIGNATURE}}</p>
</body>
</html>
</messaging:htmlEmailBody>
</messaging:emailTemplate>
